## --- Build Artifacts ---
# These are generated when you compile and should never be in Git
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
Generated\ Files/

## --- Visual Studio Specific ---
# User settings, caches, and hidden metadata
.vs/
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.suo
*.vstoken

## --- NuGet Packages ---
# Don't commit libraries; Git should restore them from the .csproj
packages/
*.nupkg

## --- OS/Environment ---
# Local secrets and system files
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

## --- Test Results ---
TestResults/
*.trx